==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
{{Lacking Sources|BotW}}
Ancient Cuirasses are pieces of [[Armor]] that can be purchased from [[Cherry|Ancient Oven]] at the [[Akkala Ancient Tech Lab]]. When worn, it provides one level of Guardian Resist Up. Ancient Cuirasses can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye|Hateno Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Ancient Cuirass joins the [[Ancient Helm]] and [[Ancient Greaves]] to compose the [[Ancient Set]]. When each piece of the Ancient Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Ancient Set is worn, it provides the "Ancient Proficiency" [[Set Bonus]].

