==={{TLoZ|-}} Collectible Cards===
{{Frameless|[[File:Nintendo Today! BotW Ancient Cuirass Collectible Card Icon.png|thumb|right|320px|alt= The Collectible Card from the Nintendo Today! app.|{{Game Label|{{Nintendo Today!|Display}}}}The Ancient Cuirass Collectible Card|link=]]}}
{{Descriptions Nintendo Today!}}
{{Main|The Legend of Zelda Collectible Cards}}
The Ancient Cuirass appeared as the daily [[The Legend of Zelda Collectible Cards|Collectible Card]] for September 28, 2026 on the [[Nintendo Today!]] app. The Collectible Card is part of the {{BotW|-}} Pack under the Item category. Its associated Quiz refers to how [[Ancient Gear]]s are required to craft Ancient Cuirasses in {{BotW}}.

By answering the Quiz correctly, players can receive a [[Medal]] which can be used to redeem other Collectible Cards or Wallpapers within the app. However, if the Collectible Card for the Ancient Cuirass is obtained via Medal Exchange, the Quiz cannot be completed and no Medal can be received.

